; BIOS end-to-end fixture (D32).
; Assembled with the firmware ROM enabled, so the machine resets into the BIOS
; reset routine (fw_reset), which configures the text screen through its MMIO
; registers and then chains here. main only draws on the screen; it never
; configures it. Seeing the character therefore proves the active BIOS enabled
; the device before the program ran.
.entry main

.section code

main:
    LI R1, 0xF000
    LI R2, 0x0042      ; 'B'
    STBI R2, [R1]      ; cell 0 of the BIOS-configured framebuffer
    HALT

.end
